            </TextRuns>
            <Style>
              <TextAlign>Left</TextAlign>
            </Style>
          </Paragraph>
          <Paragraph>
            <TextRuns>
              <TextRun>
                <Value>               2. In case Order-in-Original (Speaking Order) is required, importer/CHA are requested to apply within 30 days .</Value>
                <Style>
                  <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                  <FontFamily>Times New Roman</FontFamily>
                  <FontSize>7pt</FontSize>
                  <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
